{"title": "GERALD'S FIRST CHRISTMAS", "total": 28.532791666666665, "lines": [{"i": 0, "scene": 0, "text": "It's December, and Gerald has a problem: three hundred and forty seven boxes.", "caption": "It's December, and Gerald has a problem: three hundred and forty seven boxes.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.794708333333333}, {"i": 1, "scene": 1, "text": "So he had an idea. He'd give them all away as Christmas presents.", "caption": "So he had an idea. He'd give them all away as Christmas presents.", "start": 5.294708333333333, "end": 9.157208333333333}, {"i": 2, "scene": 2, "text": "Step one: wrap them. Gerald has never wrapped anything.", "caption": "Step one: wrap them. Gerald has never wrapped anything.", "start": 9.657208333333333, "end": 13.122208333333333}, {"i": 3, "scene": 3, "text": "Three hours later, he had wrapped exactly one present. And himself.", "caption": "Three hours later, he had wrapped exactly one present. And himself.", "start": 13.622208333333333, "end": 17.809416666666667}, {"i": 4, "scene": 4, "text": "Then, it started to snow.", "caption": "Then, it started to snow.", "start": 18.409416666666665, "end": 20.514291666666665}, {"i": 5, "scene": 5, "text": "And Gerald realised, some things are better than shopping.", "caption": "And Gerald realised, some things are better than shopping.", "start": 21.014291666666665, "end": 24.46633333333333}, {"i": 6, "scene": 6, "text": "Merry Christmas, Gerald. Next up: New Year.", "caption": "Merry Christmas, Gerald. Next up: New Year.", "start": 24.96633333333333, "end": 28.132791666666666}], "sceneStarts": [0.0, 5.294708333333333, 9.657208333333333, 13.622208333333333, 18.409416666666665, 21.014291666666665, 24.96633333333333], "caps": [[0.0, 1.1662804054054055, "It's December, and"], [1.1662804054054055, 2.5269408783783787, "Gerald has a problem:"], [2.5269408783783787, 3.628427927927928, "three hundred and"], [3.628427927927928, 4.794708333333333, "forty seven boxes."], [5.294708333333333, 6.042288978494623, "